libpeg authors and contributors

The parsing algorithm and the data structures are from "Fast Incremental
PEG Parsing" by Zachary Yedidia and Stephen Chong (SLE 2021):

    Zachary Yedidia
    Stephen Chong

This C implementation is derived from the authors' Go implementation of
that paper, github.com/zyedidia/gpeg (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2020
Zachary Yedidia), whose AVL tree code in turn derives from an MIT-licensed
AVL implementation.  

    Danila Kost


